{"id": "t082-001", "text": "Coffee with Natasha and Salma. Natasha's driving test is next Tuesday, third attempt, and she's properly nervous. Salma has gone vegan since the summer, so no more cheese boards. Text Natasha good luck the night before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Natasha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Salma", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Natasha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving test", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Salma", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegan", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "since the summer"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text Natasha good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Natasha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t082-003", "text": "Erin's recital got called off, the hall flooded. She's gutted but says they'll reschedule for spring. Her mum drove down for it anyway so they just went for dinner. Erin drinks oat flat whites, never dairy.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Erin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "reschedule", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "spring", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Erin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "drinks oat flat whites", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "never dairy", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}]}
{"id": "t082-005", "text": "Uma got her A level results back, AAB, so she's into Leeds for medicine. Her brother Santiago is starting his GCSEs this year. Their dad's doing a barbecue to celebrate this weekend. I'm bringing the halloumi. Uma's moving into halls the Sunday after, and she's already worried about cooking for herself, she can barely boil pasta.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "A level results", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "into Leeds for medicine", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Santiago", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "GCSEs", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this year", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "barbecue", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e5", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving into halls", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Sunday after", "anchor": "e5"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried about cooking for herself", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "can barely boil pasta", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t082-007", "text": "Saanvi - allergic to tree nuts, carries an EpiPen. Mihai hates coriander. Both fine with spicy. Keep in mind for the dinner on the 14th.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Saanvi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "allergic to tree nuts", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "carries an EpiPen", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mihai", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates coriander", "fact_type": "dislike", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "fine with spicy", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 14th", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t082-008", "text": "Gareth's audition for the Royal Welsh is next Thursday. He's been practising eight hours a day and isn't sleeping. Must ring him the evening before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gareth", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "audition for the Royal Welsh", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the evening before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t082-011", "text": "Laura said Pieter's band is playing the Forum the week after next. She's already got tickets for us both. Pieter is apparently a nervous wreck before every show. Laura's off sugar till Christmas. She also said Pieter's mum is coming over from Utrecht for the show and staying the whole week. Pieter's mum is a big fan of stroopwafels, apparently. I should text Pieter good luck that afternoon.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Laura", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pieter", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "playing the Forum", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after next", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pieter", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous wreck before every show", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Laura", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "off sugar", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "till Christmas"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pieter", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming over from Utrecht", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the whole week", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pieter", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "stroopwafels", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text Pieter good luck", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "p7", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pieter", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "that afternoon", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t082-014", "text": "Aidan's partner Chantal is pregnant, due in March! He told me after five a side. Chantal's off coffee completely and craving pickled onions. Get them a card.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aidan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chantal", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pregnant", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in March", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after five a side"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chantal", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "off coffee", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "craving pickled onions", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Get them a card", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t082-017", "text": "Phone call with Ahmed. His sister Rin passed her bar exam! Results came out yesterday. The family are having a dinner for her on Sunday and I'm invited. Ahmed says she loves anything with matcha, so maybe matcha chocolates as a gift.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ahmed", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rin", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "bar exam", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ahmed", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "matcha", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "matcha chocolates", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t082-019", "text": "Omar told me his dad's hip surgery went fine yesterday. He's staying with his parents until the end of the week. Omar doesn't drink at all, so no wine as a thank you, maybe dates.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Omar", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip surgery", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until the end of the week"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Omar", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't drink", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "dates", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t082-022", "text": "Amy's netball team made the county final, it's next Saturday at 2. She's captain this year. Her husband Kieran is doing the oranges at half time, his idea of support. Amy is gluten free so remember that for the team curry afterwards.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "netball", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "county final", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Saturday at 2", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "captain", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this year"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kieran", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "half time", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "gluten free", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "team curry", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t082-024", "text": "Kalani says Salma's birthday drinks are off, Salma's got flu. They'll do something the weekend after instead. Salma's into natural wine at the moment, could get a bottle for her.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kalani", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Salma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Salma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flu", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "do something", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Salma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "natural wine", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get a bottle for her", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t082-027", "text": "Chantal's play opens on Thursday at the Arts Centre, she plays Lady Macbeth. Opening night she'll be terrified, she always is. Tickets for Saturday's show booked for me and Gareth. Send her flowers that afternoon.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chantal", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "play", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Opening night", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "terrified", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "show", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gareth", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Send her flowers", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "that afternoon", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t082-028", "text": "Spoke to Santiago, he's doing Dry January again plus no caffeine. Doubt it'll last. His brother-in-law Pieter supports Ajax and they're watching the match together Tuesday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Santiago", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Dry January", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "no caffeine", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother-in-law", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pieter", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Ajax", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "match", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t082-030", "text": "Long chat with Anika. Her grandad died last week, funeral is on Monday. She's not doing great, hardly eating. Her flatmate Saanvi is looking after her. Check in with Anika on Tuesday, the day after. Saanvi said Anika keeps asking for her grandad's dal recipe, so maybe I could find one and cook it for her. Her family are all flying in from Pune for the funeral.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anika", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not doing great", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "flatmate", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Saanvi", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Check in with Anika", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anika", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Saanvi", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anika", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "dal recipe", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying in from Pune", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r3"}]}
{"id": "t082-031", "text": "Gintaras is vegetarian now?? Since when. Also his son Joe got into the county under-14s squad, first match Sunday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gintaras", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegetarian", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joe", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into the county under-14s squad", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first match", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t082-034", "text": "Grandma's 90th next month. Order the photo book by Friday.", "spans": [{"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "Grandma"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "90th", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Order the photo book", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Friday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t082-035", "text": "Nikolai Costa, the chef from the market, does a mean borscht. Hates mushrooms, oddly. Opening a stall in Peckham in the spring.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nikolai Costa", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "chef from the market", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "does a mean borscht", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Hates mushrooms", "fact_type": "dislike", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Opening a stall in Peckham", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t082-037", "text": "Joe's darts final is tomorrow night. He's weirdly calm about it. Ahmed's driving us there, and Omar's coming if his shift finishes early. Joe only drinks shandy before matches, says it steadies his hand. If he wins he goes through to the regional finals in Blackpool in a fortnight. His wife is not thrilled about another weekend away.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joe", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "darts final", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow night", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "weirdly calm", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ahmed", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Omar", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joe", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "only drinks shandy before matches", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "regional finals in Blackpool", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "not thrilled about another weekend away", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "r1"}]}
{"id": "t082-039", "text": "Amy said Jin's allergic to shellfish, proper hospital-level allergic. And Jin's girlfriend Kalani won't eat anything spicy. Remember for the curry night on Friday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amy", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jin", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "allergic to shellfish", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jin", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p4"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kalani", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "won't eat anything spicy", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p4"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "curry night", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t082-041", "text": "Pieter's driving test was cancelled by the examiner, sick apparently. Rebooked for the 30th. He's annoyed because he'd taken the day off. His sister Laura is lending him her car for practice in the meantime.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pieter", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "examiner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Rebooked", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 30th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "annoyed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Laura", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the meantime", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t082-043", "text": "Haruto Shah texted, his cat Miso has a dental op on Friday. He's anxious about the anaesthetic. Message him Friday afternoon to see how she got on.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Haruto Shah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Miso", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dental op", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "anxious about the anaesthetic", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Message him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday afternoon", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t082-045", "text": "James had his MOT and also his citizenship test on the same day yesterday, passed both! He's celebrating with a curry tomorrow. He's not really drinking at the moment, so I'll order him a mango lassi.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "James", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "MOT", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "citizenship test", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the same day yesterday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "celebrating with a curry", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not really drinking", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}]}
{"id": "t082-047", "text": "Omar's daughter is in the school play next Wednesday, she's a tree. He's taking half a day off. Their whole family is going, even his in-laws from Bradford. Omar said afterwards they'll go for pizza, his daughter only eats margherita.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Omar", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "school play", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Wednesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "in-laws", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "from Bradford", "owner": "r3", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Omar", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r4", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "only eats margherita", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "diet"}]}
{"id": "t082-048", "text": "Andile, Mihai and me did the quiz at the Lamb. Came second. Mihai mentioned he's sitting his ACCA exams in early December and is worried about the tax paper. Andile told me his wife's expecting their second in May. Andile's switched to alcohol free beer in solidarity. Remind me to drop Mihai a good luck text the day before the first exam, and to get something for Andile's baby before May.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Andile", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mihai", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mihai", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "ACCA exams", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in early December", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried about the tax paper", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Andile", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in May", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Andile", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "switched to alcohol free beer", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop Mihai a good luck text", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mihai", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before the first exam", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get something for Andile's baby", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before", "owner": "r2", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p7", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Andile", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "baby", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "before May", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t082-049", "text": "Dafydd's mum is in hospital with pneumonia. He's been driving up every evening after work and is exhausted. Call him at the weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dafydd", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pneumonia", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "every evening after work"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Call him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t082-053", "text": "Yosef mentioned his uncle Reza is retiring Friday after forty years as a bus driver. Big do at the depot afterwards. Yosef's making the cake, a lemon drizzle because Reza doesn't like chocolate.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yosef", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "uncle", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Reza", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "forty years as a bus driver", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "do at the depot", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yosef", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Reza", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't like chocolate", "fact_type": "dislike", "owner": "p2"}]}
{"id": "t082-058", "text": "Amy's son Sam got his black belt in karate yesterday! Took him four years. She's throwing a small party for him Sunday afternoon. He loves Lego so a set would be ideal.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sam", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "black belt in karate", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "party", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday afternoon", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Lego", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "a set would be ideal", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t082-059", "text": "Erin said her driving test is next Friday and then the following Monday she has a job interview at the vets. Big week. She's surviving on energy drinks, which isn't great. She seemed calm about the interview but terrified about the test. Text her on Thursday night and again Monday morning.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Erin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving test", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the following Monday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job interview at the vets", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "calm about the interview", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "terrified about the test", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday night", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "again", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "message", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday morning", "anchor": "a2"}]}
